Z||000000||ramzy_steele||09-06-2000||11:37 AM||||I am not claiming to be super mechanic thus I am here.  Ive been told and fro what I have seen you can take a front wheel drive cars engine and tans-axle(I think thats right) and ut it int he rear of the fiero.  Of course you would have to change a few mounts.  But compared to spending a grand or 2 this would be cheaper I would suppose.  Does anyone know if this is possible.  I assume so since Im seeing caddy conversions.  And I dont know fo any adapters for that yet.  Please tell me if this will work and all parts you think I will have to change.  Thanks||||reg||4
